WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.690
What we searched for was the meaning behind courage.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:08.770
We couldn’t see the present,
and instead we ran away to our dreams and the future.

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:11.900
When I couldn’t do anything and kept hurting things.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.070
When I couldn’t do anything but hang my head.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:22.410
What we were taught was
the heart and power to face these things.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:26.240
That which we can do now.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.460
So that we can protect what’s important to us...

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.900
We will focus on what’s ahead of us.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:36.320
So that this incident doesn’t end in regrets and tears,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:40.010
we will go and save you right now.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:05.960
The things that I can do for you and no one else

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:11.660
I honestly feel and wish for those

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:18.380
I am frozen by uncertainties

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:24.620
By the rules I have been relying on

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:30.320
My past embellished with excuses

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:34.520
I want to get over it

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.800
Staining the stars in heaven scarlet

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.270
Gather the grains of miracles

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.530
Before the still, unseen night

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.810
I want to tell you that I am escaping from illusions

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.990
The twilight moon calls out to me

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.080
Removing my veil of delusions

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.290
My hidden, deceitful self

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.170
And took all of my weaknesses

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:07.630
I don’t want words that seem passionate

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:17.050
The fact that I’m here right now is my truth

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.880
The fleet is in position.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.550
We’re ready to attack.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.160
Nanoha.

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:43.660
Fate.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:45.100
Hayate.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.080
Please hurry and escape.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:58.760
It’s impossible.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.390
I can’t gather any mana!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.570
Comms are down too!

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:04.990
Looks like we have no choice but to escape on foot.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.160
But Nanoha is...

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:13.620
I’m fine. I can walk.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:14.570
Mama.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:20.700
All hands to your stations. Repeat, all hands to your stations.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.500
Commencing emergency repair of damaged areas.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.540
Please step away from any damaged walls

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.660
or emergency barriers.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.400
Let’s hurry to the exit.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.810
I’ll leave her in your custody.

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:46.410
Yes, Sister.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.390
I’ll go save Enforcer Fate.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:50.890
Schach.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.790
You can’t go with those wounds.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.240
I’ll go instead.

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:55.780
But...!

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:57.710
Please wait.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:00.390
I think I’ll be able to escape on my own.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:03.630
Besides, if we don’t stop the collapse...

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:08.010
All the people in these pods might still be alive.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.710
We can’t let them die in the collapse.

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:11.430
But...!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.550
I’ll stop it!

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.680
Shari!

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.650
Yes, Fate.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:30.230
I will head to the sky.

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:32.750
Agito, what will you do?

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:38.630
Y-You killed him!

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:46.340
But you gave him his last moment of honor as a knight.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:50.870
He entrusted me to you.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.230
So, I will go with you.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.550
I will stay by your side and watch you.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:04.130
If by chance you betray what he was saying...

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:08.280
If that were to happen,
I wish for you to kill me with your flame.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:17.480
<b>Unison in!</b>

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:26.300
T-That’s...!

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.100
Sergeant Vice!

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:30.710
Listen up.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:35.960
It seems that the further into the ship you go,
the stronger the A.M.F. becomes.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.020
We’ll get you close enough that a Wingroad will reach.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.390
Break through with that, and pick up the officers!

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:43.360
Yes, sir!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:46.010
Let’s go, Storm Raider.

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:52.140
I told you before, I’m not an ace, nor am I an expert.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:06:01.040
I got frightened in an incident that a relative was involved in and fired a shot I couldn’t take back.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:04.970
I felt so pathetic that I thought I’d die.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:14.790
But you know, I’m at least good enough
to create a path for my reckless, rash subordinates.

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.650
Okay, go!

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:23.010
Yes, sir!

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:26.280
<b>Wingroad</b>

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:28.510
Go!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.750
The smaller aerial units are descending to the ground!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.360
Are there any aerial mages?

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:44.770
At this current point in time,
the only mages who can act are...

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:47.990
There’s one!

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.680
Riot Force 6, Lightning 2, First Lieutenant Signum.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.940
That voice... is that you, Lucino?

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:55.080
Yes, ma’am.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:59.120
Huh? Lt. Signum, you look...

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:02.560
A strong ally came with me.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.550
I’ll intercept them from my current position.

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:05.360
Understood.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.690
Forty-eight of them and counting.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.340
Can you do it, Agito?

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.890
I can.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.940
Flame on!

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:17.890
<b>Raging Fire Sword</b>

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.500
Lævateinn.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.190
Snake Form

00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.030
The blazing flash of my sword!

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.500
<b>Firebreathing...</b>

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.250
<b>...Swordflash</b>

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.340
F-Fifty units have been wiped out all at once!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.150
I wonder why, Agito.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:08:03.120
When I’m in Unison with you,
my heart strangely feels warm.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:07.080
Agito?

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.030
It’s nothing!

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.670
Nothing!

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:14.620
At distance 450, a second formation incoming.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.990
Got it. Let’s go, Agito!

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:19.140
Right, Signum!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:27.610
Erio. Fried.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:30.340
Voltaire and I will help the G.A.S.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:30.960
Got it.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:37.700
Kerykeion, give Erio and Fried a speed boost. Full Drive!

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.850
Boost Up

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.130
You’re overdoing it, Second Lieutenant Vita!

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:49.480
Shut up!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:58.210
Lt. Vita, we’re glad you’re okay.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:09:00.930
We’re going to rescue Nanoha and Commander Yagami!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.160
We’re off!

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.480
They’re...

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.260
Those girls.

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:12.890
I can’t gather any mana at all.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:16.910
But if I’m in combat cyborg mode, I can shoot and run.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:22.540
The two of us together will rescue them and return.

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:25.080
Yeah!

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:31.520
Data analyzed. Passcode cracked.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.130
Fate!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.300
Done.

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:45.270
It stopped.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.250
Yes, ma’am.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.900
Sonic Move

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:01.390
Erio?

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.530
Yes, ma’am.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:20.830
I chose this path the day I started looking up to Nanoha.

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:26.080
This sound...

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.220
No way!

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:28.440
Way.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.840
Subaru.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.660
Mom,

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.100
Ginny,

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.620
lend me your power for just a bit.

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:10.300
Sorry for making you wait!

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:12.650
We’re here to save you!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:21.190
Tremors have ceased at Scaglietti’s HQ.

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:27.120
Escape has been confirmed for the Assault Team,
as well as Lightning 1 and Lightning 3.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:33.000
The mages which had infiltrated the <i>Cradle,</i>
units 1 through 4, have escaped the scene.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.960
The Riot Force 6 members in the deepest areas...

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.840
We have confirmed their escape.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:48.710
So it’s our job from this point on.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:49.980
Yes, sir.

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:21.010
The <i>Cradle</i> has been shot down.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.120
Mission complete.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.740
We did it! We really did it!

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:30.200
Shari, just for a second...

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.930
Everyone, good job.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:50.850
And so ended the case that started as the Relic Incident.

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:54.770
It was long after this incident,
which involved many people and things, had ended

00:12:54.770 --> 00:13:04.990
that it came to be called the Jail Scaglietti Incident,
or simply the J.S. Incident.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:33.520
Scaglietti, who had been arrested, and the combat cyborgs who didn’t show interest in helping with the investigation

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.480
are on various planets in orbital detention facilities.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:45.620
Those who recognized their crimes
and seemed like they would help with the investigation

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:48.410
are in a maritime quarantine facility on Mid.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:57.250
The two whom the Lightning squad protected, Lutecia and Agito, decided to stay there on their own.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.840
Still, I think you guys can leave soon.

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:05.550
Your psych eval showed that you were not liable due to lack of control.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:07.910
But besides that, there are a lot of other factors.

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:13.490
It didn’t seem like Agito had to come.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:17.480
I was worried about Lulu.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:21.880
And on top of that, after this, I’ll have to do my part.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:28.820
Oh yeah, Miss Lu, how’s your mother?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:33.580
She’s sleeping at the hospital.

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:42.720
They said if they treat her, even without a Relic, she’ll wake up eventually.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:51.080
Peace had come to Mid’s surface once more,
and repairs to the Riot Force 6 HQ have been completed.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:54.540
All members have returned to their posts.

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:06.050
Vivio has returned after being examined in protective custody for a short period and is living peacefully with her mamas.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:15.500
But Hayate, since the incident, you’ve been pretty quiet.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:16.890
Has fatigue finally set in?

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:23.560
I heard from Signum concerning Lt. General Regius.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:28.990
It’s kind of like, you know, his thoughts were just like mine.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:36.540
I wanted to protect because I had lost many things, and due to that, I became frantic to do so and ended up overdoing it.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:42.610
No matter what type of feelings or thoughts you have,
if they get too strong, they’ll sabotage everything.

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:49.330
And the more time you spend on them,
the more you lose them, and the more moot it becomes.

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:55.140
But if we rush too much to find an answer,
only pain will result.

00:15:57.690 --> 00:16:04.000
But you know, with colleagues like you,
I feel like I’m the youngest child in the family.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.010
So you’ve finally realized?

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:07.750
You’re still a kid.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:14.070
So, have you decided on the future of the kids in your unit?

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:17.240
Well, for the most part.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:24.110
That’s right. It’s been a year since
Riot Force 6’s probationary operation period began.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:29.150
When spring comes, we’ll be graduating.

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:41.640
Thanks to the data you brought back, we were able to clean up the Combat Cyborg Incident very nicely.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:46.610
My wife, as well as the rest of the people
in Zest’s team, will finally be able to rest in peace.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.530
And then...

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.920
It’s been a year, though it felt like much longer,

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:28.360
so Riot Force 6 will disperse, having completed its mission.

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:35.740
I am truly happy from the bottom of my heart,
having worked and fought alongside all of you.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:40.410
I pray that you all fare well
in your next unit and that you do to your best there.

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:52.990
It kind of seems like it ended pretty quick.

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.280
Doesn’t it?

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:57.740
Well, after this, I hear there’s a farewell party.

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:03.340
Subaru doesn’t seem too happy.

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:09.980
Well, she’s leaving Nanoha,
and Tia won’t be with her in her next assignment.

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:14.510
Hey, everyone! Wait up!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.760
Nanoha.

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:19.520
Ginny too.

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:24.240
Before the farewell party,
we’d like to see all the forward members.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.870
These flowers, they’re...

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:32.900
Yes, they’re flowers from the world Nanoha and I are from.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:37.540
They’re flowers that represent a farewell and the beginning of a new season.

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:40.740
Okay, forwards, line up!

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:41.570
Yes, ma’am!

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:50.920
Okay, first of all, you four have done a great job
on your missions and training this year.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:54.960
This past year, I haven’t praised you much, but...

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:59.940
...you guys have gotten pretty strong.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:05.790
You’ve had tough training, were put in hard spots,
and had difficult missions.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:12.080
But you’ve tried your best
and gotten past all of them without fail.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:19.870
All of you have really gotten stronger.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:23.830
The four of you are already great strikers.

00:19:26.740 --> 00:19:30.220
<i>Ach,</i> don’t cry, you idiots.

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:31.350
Yes, ma’am.

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:37.010
Well then, since you’re finally graduating,
and the cherry blossoms are in full bloom,

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:39.400
let’s not be gloomy.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:40.260
Yes.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.780
You’ve brought your partners with you, right?

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.570
What is it?

00:19:49.570 --> 00:19:51.530
You didn’t hear?

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:57.630
Full power, without holding back, Riot Force 6’s last mock battle!

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:02.670
Yes, ma’am!

00:20:02.670 --> 00:20:06.110
I didn’t hear about us not holding back!

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:08.060
Well, let us go at it anyway.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.770
This is a memory too.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:13.270
Aw... Vita, Nanoha.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.960
Don’t be so stiff.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.430
We finally got our limiters taken off, after all.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:21.110
There’s nothing to worry about. They’re all strong, after all.

00:20:21.930 --> 00:20:24.470
Mama Fate, it’s okay.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.020
Full power!

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.330
Let’s do our best!

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.740
Fate, please!

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:34.710
Please try your best to win!

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.000
Aw, man...

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.920
Try your best!

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:10.890
Well then.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:17.440
Ready!

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:22.990
Go!

00:24:26.840 --> 00:24:27.760
Someone!

00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:29.050
Save me!

00:24:38.270 --> 00:24:39.390
Protection

00:24:41.120 --> 00:24:43.640
You’ve tried your best. That’s great.

00:24:44.070 --> 00:24:45.990
It’s okay now.

00:24:45.990 --> 00:24:49.490
I’ll take you straight to a safe place.

00:25:06.730 --> 00:25:11.860
For the next three weeks, I’ll be in charge of training you all.

00:25:11.860 --> 00:25:14.510
I’m Captain Nanoha Takamachi.

00:25:15.310 --> 00:25:19.990
The training will be a bit tough, but stick with it, okay?

00:25:19.990 --> 00:25:20.910
Yes, ma’am!

00:25:23.740 --> 00:25:28.220
Okay, so let’s go at it!

00:25:28.220 --> 00:25:29.090
Yes, ma’am!
